# One environment for the whole Sol-H3-Spark v2 pipeline (Qwen worker, H3 stage1, LTX stage2), replacing the
# image's system python (Qwen, NGC torch 2.10), sol-stage1 (torch 2.12.0+cu130) and sol-stage2 (torch 2.13.0+cu132).
# Latest stable versions as of 2026-10-27; the union of both envs' packages plus ComfyUI's core requirements.
# Not installed here, built against this torch from the sources of configs/dependencies.json (the FastVideo and
# LTX-2 h3-spark-unified branches): fastvideo-kernel, ltx-core / ltx-pipelines / ltx-kernels (uv pip install
# --no-build-isolation --no-deps, TORCH_CUDA_ARCH_LIST=12.1). FastVideo, FA4 and ComfyUI stay on PYTHONPATH.
# Install this lock with: uv pip install --no-deps -r unified.lock (the lock is complete; torch's own CUDA pins
# are overridden by overrides.txt).

# CUDA 13.2 torch stack
torch==2.14.1
torchvision
# torchaudio 2.11.0 (latest) +cu132 for aarch64 is only on the PyTorch test channel (PyPI's is cu130, rejected at import
# by torch cu132); its extensions are stable-ABI (.abi3.so), as sol-stage2 used with torch 2.13
torchaudio @ https://download.pytorch.org/whl/test/cu132/torchaudio-2.11.0%2Bcu132-cp312-cp312-manylinux_2_28_aarch64.whl
triton
nvidia-cudnn-frontend
nvidia-cutlass-dsl[cu13]==4.8.1
cuda-python
apache-tvm-ffi
# FA4 (the two H3 text-refiner blocks) dependencies, as its isolated fa4-post3-v1 set had them
quack-kernels
# CUDA 13.2 toolkit from pip, matching torch's runtime, for building fastvideo-kernel and ltx-kernels (as sol-stage2 did)
nvidia-cuda-nvcc>=13.2,<13.3
nvidia-cuda-cccl>=13.2,<13.3
nvidia-cuda-crt>=13.2,<13.3
nvidia-nvvm>=13.2,<13.3
nvidia-cuda-nvdisasm>=13.2,<13.3
cmake
scikit-build-core
setuptools
wheel
ninja

# Model code (H3 stage1, LTX stage2)
